  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerToken": "char_456_ash_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_456_ash",
      "portraitKey": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "Rangers's map stops here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerToken": "char_456_ash_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_456_ash",
      "portraitKey": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "It's all up to us now."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blitz",
      "speakerToken": "char_457_blitz_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_457_blitz",
      "portraitKey": "char_457_blitz",
      "text": "Who knew this cave would be so big?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blitz",
      "speakerToken": "char_457_blitz_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_457_blitz",
      "portraitKey": "char_457_blitz",
      "text": "It's like the ground beneath the town is completely hollow."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerToken": "char_456_ash_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_456_ash",
      "portraitKey": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "Are the explosives okay?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Schwarz",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_166",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We've got the strongest batch from the safehouse here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerToken": "char_456_ash_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_456_ash",
      "portraitKey": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "I hope Lord's plan works."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Schwarz",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_166",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I'm afraid it won't be that simple. Look there..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerToken": "char_456_ash_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_456_ash",
      "portraitKey": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "...I hope it's not what I think it is..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Originiutant Infected",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_015",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Gaa..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blitz",
      "speakerToken": "char_457_blitz_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_457_blitz",
      "portraitKey": "char_457_blitz",
      "text": "That's... a person?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Originiutant Infected",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_015",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Gaa..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Schwarz",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_166",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Whatever it is, it's going to die and that's enough."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blitz",
      "speakerToken": "char_457_blitz_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_457_blitz",
      "portraitKey": "char_457_blitz",
      "text": "I won't be surprised at whatever *profanity* showing up now..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerToken": "char_456_ash_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_456_ash",
      "portraitKey": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "Keep moving! Don't get caught up in a fight with them. We don't have time to waste in here!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blitz",
      "speakerToken": "char_457_blitz_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_457_blitz",
      "portraitKey": "char_457_blitz",
      "text": "Understood."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Schwarz",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_166",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...Why would Long Spring have a facility like this underneath it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blitz",
      "speakerToken": "char_457_blitz_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_457_blitz",
      "portraitKey": "char_457_blitz",
      "text": "Cohen... Where are we?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerToken": "char_456_ash_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_456_ash",
      "portraitKey": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "I knew it! *profanity*, I knew it!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blitz",
      "speakerToken": "char_457_blitz_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_457_blitz",
      "portraitKey": "char_457_blitz",
      "text": "So this is where most of the lab ended up."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerToken": "char_456_ash_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_456_ash",
      "portraitKey": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "Now that I think about it, we were too careless."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerToken": "char_456_ash_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_456_ash",
      "portraitKey": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "We've lived in this town for so long and we had no idea at all."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blitz",
      "speakerToken": "char_457_blitz_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_457_blitz",
      "portraitKey": "char_457_blitz",
      "text": "It's that psycho behind all this."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blitz",
      "speakerToken": "char_457_blitz_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_457_blitz",
      "portraitKey": "char_457_blitz",
      "text": "What's that smell...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerToken": "char_456_ash_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_456_ash",
      "portraitKey": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "What else could it be? That's the smell of death."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Schwarz",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_166",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerToken": "char_456_ash_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_456_ash",
      "portraitKey": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "Stay frosty. And close."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blitz",
      "speakerToken": "char_457_blitz_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_457_blitz",
      "portraitKey": "char_457_blitz",
      "text": "What are these?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blitz",
      "speakerToken": "char_457_blitz_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_457_blitz",
      "portraitKey": "char_457_blitz",
      "text": "Cages? So many?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Schwarz",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_166",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "All corpses... people and beasts together..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerToken": "char_456_ash_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_456_ash",
      "portraitKey": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "This is the work of Lev Klitschko, a man both mad and cruel beyond imagination. I never should've tried to take him alive. He should have a bullet in his head."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blitz",
      "speakerToken": "char_457_blitz_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_457_blitz",
      "portraitKey": "char_457_blitz",
      "text": "Your typical madman wouldn't do something this awful."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Schwarz",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_166",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Wait."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Schwarz",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_166",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...There's someone alive in that cage."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Drudge",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_158_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Heh."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Drudge",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_158_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Look who's here?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerToken": "char_456_ash_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_456_ash",
      "portraitKey": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blitz",
      "speakerToken": "char_457_blitz_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_457_blitz",
      "portraitKey": "char_457_blitz",
      "text": "It's that Drudge character."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerToken": "char_456_ash_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_456_ash",
      "portraitKey": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "I'd recognize the *profanity* anywhere."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Drudge",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_158_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Oh, it's you. The mercenaries."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Drudge",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_158_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I'm so glad to see you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Drudge",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_158_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I know we've had our differences in the past... but let's set them aside for now."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Drudge",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_158_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I have a feeling you're looking for that scientist... and I know where he is."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Drudge",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_158_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We've got a common enemy. And the enemy of my enemy is my friend."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerToken": "char_456_ash_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_456_ash",
      "portraitKey": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "So brazen I'm sick to my stomach."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Drudge",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_158_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "That Feline over there, I know you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Drudge",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_158_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Your skills are pretty easily recognizable. And one can hear a lot in the mercenary market in Columbia."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Drudge",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_158_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You are a killer, aren't you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Schwarz",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_166",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Drudge",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_158_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Rhodes Island hired you, meaning even they have quite some dirty work to do."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Drudge",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_158_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Compared to others, you must know better how to weigh up the pros and cons. Let's have a talk, shall we?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Schwarz",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_166",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Shut up. Or I can help you with that."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Drudge",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_158_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Shame. I thought people like you would be more realistic."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerToken": "char_456_ash_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_456_ash",
      "portraitKey": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "Open the cage."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Schwarz",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_166",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerToken": "char_456_ash_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_456_ash",
      "portraitKey": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "Don't worry about it. Just open the cage."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Schwarz",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_166",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Schwarz",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_166",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Got it."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Drudge",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_158_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Good call. We all know the score."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerToken": "char_456_ash_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_456_ash",
      "portraitKey": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "Yeah. I sure do."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Drudge",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_158_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hold on, what are you doing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Drudge",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_158_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Agh!!!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Drudge",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_158_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hey! You crazy..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Drudge",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_158_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Drudge",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_158_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Help me......please......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Drudge",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_158_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Please..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Drudge",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_158_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Drudge",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_158_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Please... stop."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_158_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hah. You can still talk. Guess I'm not done."
