    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerToken": "char_456_ash_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_456_ash",
      "portraitKey": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "What... you feel bad for him?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blitz",
      "speakerToken": "char_457_blitz_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_457_blitz",
      "portraitKey": "char_457_blitz",
      "text": "Man, you almost killed him."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blitz",
      "speakerToken": "char_457_blitz_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_457_blitz",
      "portraitKey": "char_457_blitz",
      "text": "Totally rearranged his face."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blitz",
      "speakerToken": "char_457_blitz_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_457_blitz",
      "portraitKey": "char_457_blitz",
      "text": "Save your strength. We've still got work to do."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerToken": "char_456_ash_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_456_ash",
      "portraitKey": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "You're right."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Schwarz",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_166",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Pfft."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerToken": "char_456_ash_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_456_ash",
      "portraitKey": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "What happened?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Schwarz",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_166",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Nothing. I'm just feeling a lot more relaxed."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerToken": "char_456_ash_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_456_ash",
      "portraitKey": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "You know what? Me too."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blitz",
      "speakerToken": "char_457_blitz_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_457_blitz",
      "portraitKey": "char_457_blitz",
      "text": "If he's locked up in here, he must be part of Lev's plan."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerToken": "char_456_ash_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_456_ash",
      "portraitKey": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "I'm not surprised."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Schwarz",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_166",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I don't see anyone here..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Schwarz",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_166",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Might be an ambush ahead. Keep cautious."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Levi",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_157_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Well well well, look who it is. More visitors to my laboratory?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Levi",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_157_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It's been a while, my friends from Team Rainbow."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Levi",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_157_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You're just in time."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Levi",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_157_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "No... you always come at precisely the right time."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerToken": "char_456_ash_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_456_ash",
      "portraitKey": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "Tch."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Levi",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_157_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Don't bother. It's bulletproof glass."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Levi",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_157_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I applaud your decisiveness, squeezing the trigger without hesitation. Don't even wait for an end to our little prologue here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Levi",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_157_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But we have a show to put on. A great opening requires a great audience, and a complete opening dialogue."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Levi",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_157_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Today is a day of praise for the great work of the Creator. And that Creator is none other than yours truly."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerToken": "char_456_ash_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_456_ash",
      "portraitKey": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "Creator? That's quite a title you've given yourself."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerToken": "char_456_ash_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_456_ash",
      "portraitKey": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "You're a *profanity* psycho!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Levi",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_157_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Psycho... hah. The mediocre always use this word to describe ideas and concepts they cannot understand."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Levi",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_157_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Behold this world!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Levi",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_157_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Completely different chemistry... totally inverted laws of physics... the flower of science blooms in exploration and doubt. And the most fertile soil lies in the land of the unknown!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Levi",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_157_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "And now, I have succeeded."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Levi",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_157_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Do you see? Can you feel? The surface appearance is similar, but it all functions on radically different principles!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Levi",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_157_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "This is the evolution of life. This is the iteration of existence."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Levi",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_157_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Originium is the truth of this world. You should accept that. Don't fear it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Levi",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_157_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Welcome to the future."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerToken": "char_456_ash_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_456_ash",
      "portraitKey": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "Don't you have even the slightest moral compunction over what you're doing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerToken": "char_456_ash_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_456_ash",
      "portraitKey": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "What does human life even mean to you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Levi",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_157_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Human nature is weak, good and evil are subjective definitions of weakness, and what we call guilt is but one of the myriad cognitive signals produced by the brain."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Levi",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_157_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "And the science I pursue is never swayed by such flimsy concepts."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Levi",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_157_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Don't delude yourselves that even in this world you still bind your minds with these meaningless ideas."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Levi",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_157_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Even electronic information technology and nuclear energy were originally designed to help us kill each other more effectively."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Levi",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_157_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Would you add a new layer of definition to science? Force everything to fit your fragile spiritual needs?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Levi",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_157_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Nonsense."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Levi",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_157_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But I forgive you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Levi",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_157_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You don't have to understand. I'll allow you to go on, unknowing. Primitive thinking is a common form of ignorance. It's not your fault, and I forgive you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Levi",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_157_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "That's the end of my speech. And in addition to my forgiveness, I also offer you my thanks for waiting so patiently."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Levi",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_157_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Now it is time for praise. Give your praise to this entirely new life form."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Levi",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_157_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Praise be! Praise be! Praise be!!!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "No matter what, we absolutely can't let that thing make it to the surface."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blitz",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You stall it! I'll get the bomb ready!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
